    'Use of AI tools: as allowed by Section 4 of the project guidelines, we used AI-assisted tools to help with parts of the coding and documentation. The requirements, design decisions, priorities and trade-offs were decided by the team. We reviewed everything the tools produced, checked it with the 283 automated tests that run on every commit, and documented it. Each member can explain the parts of the system they worked on.',
